msgid "Open in Colab"
msgstr "在 Colab 中打开"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:8
#: 7fa88d17ebca44229bce9d4f65777b23
msgid ""
"The entry point to mixed assembly: the script "
"``examples/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood/stokes_taylor_hood.py`` solves a "
"**manufactured** incompressible Stokes problem on the unit square with "
"the classic Taylor-Hood P2-P1 pair, verifies the solution against the "
"exact fields, and runs an h-refinement convergence study. If you are new "
"to :class:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler`, start here — the "
":doc:`cavity <cavity>`, :doc:`cylinder <cylinder_flow>` and :doc"
":`Rayleigh-Bénard <rayleigh_benard>` examples all build on this pattern. "
"The concepts are covered in :doc:`../../user_guide/mixed_assembly`."
msgstr ""
"混合装配的入口：脚本 ``examples/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood/stokes_taylor_hood.py`` "
"在单位正方形上求解一个 **构造的** 不可压缩 Stokes 问题，采用经典的 Taylor-Hood P2-P1 "
"元组，将解与精确场进行验证，并开展 h 加密收敛性研究。如果您刚接触 "
":class:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler`\\ ，请从这里开始 —— :doc:`cavity "
"<cavity>`\\ 、\\ :doc:`cylinder <cylinder_flow>` 和 :doc:`Rayleigh-Bénard "
"<rayleigh_benard>` 示例均基于这一模式构建。相关概念详见 "
":doc:`../../user_guide/mixed_assembly`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:21
#: ea21ce0a3ac4456f82fd86c5b7eae534
msgid "Problem"
msgstr "问题"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:23
#: c673ac81215d44c68f7dcff934ebfeba
msgid "The Stokes equations with a body force,"
msgstr "带体积力的 Stokes 方程，"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:25
#: accd23bb31b7465b99c1bd1d9f3ae27e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"-\\mu\\, \\Delta \\mathbf{u} + \\nabla p = \\mathbf{f}\n"
"\\quad \\text{in } \\Omega = (0,1)^2,\n"
"\\qquad \\nabla \\cdot \\mathbf{u} = 0,"
msgstr ""
"-\\mu\\, \\Delta \\mathbf{u} + \\nabla p = \\mathbf{f}\n"
"\\quad \\text{in } \\Omega = (0,1)^2,\n"
"\\qquad \\nabla \\cdot \\mathbf{u} = 0,"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:31
#: b988f4f6816f42439615a277b2193086
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"with :math:`\\mathbf{f}` manufactured from a divergence-free exact "
"velocity (derived from the stream function :math:`\\psi = \\sin^2(\\pi "
"x)\\,\\sin^2(\\pi y)`) and the exact pressure :math:`p = \\sin(\\pi "
"x)\\cos(\\pi y)`. Dirichlet data on the boundary is the exact velocity; "
"one pressure DOF is pinned to the exact value to fix the constant null "
"space."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\mathbf{f}` 由一个无散度的精确速度（由流函数 :math:`\\psi = \\sin^2(\\pi "
"x)\\,\\sin^2(\\pi y)` 导出）和精确压力 :math:`p = \\sin(\\pi x)\\cos(\\pi y)` "
"构造而来。边界上的狄利克雷数据为精确速度；一个压力自由度被固定为精确值以消除常数零空间。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:38
#: d9ca79715f6c4853b71447670ffd9b34
msgid ""
"Because the exact pressure is *not* in the P1 space and the exact "
"velocity is not in the P2 space, the discrete errors are genuine "
"approximation errors — ideal for measuring convergence rates."
msgstr "由于精确压力 *不在* P1 空间中，且精确速度不在 P2 空间中，离散误差是真正的逼近误差 —— 非常适合测量收敛速率。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:44
#: aa561c92a1d64a6aa942a65120baf215
msgid "The mixed weak form"
msgstr "混合弱形式"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:46
#: ef20ce1716224e60afb4dfd6da8ac934
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Multiply by test functions :math:`(\\mathbf{v}, q)` and integrate by "
"parts:"
msgstr "乘以测试函数 :math:`(\\mathbf{v}, q)` 并分部积分："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:49
#: 4a5765e9ed784a5287cc3b1924c1b504
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\int_\\Omega \\mu\\,\\nabla\\mathbf{u} : "
"\\nabla\\mathbf{v}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n"
"- \\int_\\Omega p\\,(\\nabla\\cdot\\mathbf{v})\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n"
"- \\int_\\Omega q\\,(\\nabla\\cdot\\mathbf{u})\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n"
"\\;=\\; \\int_\\Omega \\mathbf{f}\\cdot\\mathbf{v}\\,\\mathrm{d}x ."
msgstr ""
"\\int_\\Omega \\mu\\,\\nabla\\mathbf{u} : "
"\\nabla\\mathbf{v}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n"
"- \\int_\\Omega p\\,(\\nabla\\cdot\\mathbf{v})\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n"
"- \\int_\\Omega q\\,(\\nabla\\cdot\\mathbf{u})\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n"
"\\;=\\; \\int_\\Omega \\mathbf{f}\\cdot\\mathbf{v}\\,\\mathrm{d}x ."

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:56
#: 16e07588a7c843debe7fcae959543852
msgid ""
"In TensorMesh this *is* the code — two field declarations and a four-line"
" integrand:"
msgstr "在 TensorMesh 中这 *就是* 代码 —— 两个场声明和一个四行积分项："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:59
#: 2baf9ed3d3394d72b2328c61687cb347
msgid "examples/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood/stokes_taylor_hood.py (essence)"
msgstr "examples/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood/stokes_taylor_hood.py（核心部分）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:76
#: abbb92587b404187bc7ec1e8e9338623
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``gradu`` is the :math:`2 \\times 2` velocity Jacobian, so ``(gradu * "
"gradv).sum()`` is :math:`\\nabla\\mathbf{u}:\\nabla\\mathbf{v}` and "
"``gradu.diagonal().sum()`` is :math:`\\nabla\\cdot\\mathbf{u}`. Trial "
"fields ``(u, p)`` index matrix columns, test fields ``(v, q)`` rows. The "
"P2-P1 pair satisfies the discrete inf-sup (LBB) condition, so no "
"stabilization terms appear anywhere."
msgstr ""
"``gradu`` 是 :math:`2 \\times 2` 速度雅可比矩阵，因此 ``(gradu * gradv).sum()`` 即 "
":math:`\\nabla\\mathbf{u}:\\nabla\\mathbf{v}`\\ ，\\ "
"``gradu.diagonal().sum()`` 即 :math:`\\nabla\\cdot\\mathbf{u}`\\ 。试函数 "
"``(u, p)`` 索引矩阵列，测试函数 ``(v, q)`` 索引行。P2-P1 元组满足离散 inf-"
"sup（LBB）条件，因此任何地方都不出现稳定化项。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:85
#: b47e1d01ba8e47e2abed764b14f50c86
msgid "Boundary conditions via the layout"
msgstr "通过 layout 施加边界条件"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:87
#: e03ecf1a567d4c4883dff3c6a417aa59
msgid ""
"``assembler.layout`` translates \"field, nodes, component\" into global "
"block-DOF indices, so the saddle-point structure never leaks into the BC "
"code:"
msgstr "``assembler.layout`` 将\"场、节点、分量\"翻译为全局块自由度索引，因此鞍点结构不会泄漏到边界条件代码中："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:107
#: fa03a26871eb445487f4dd5949dde595
msgid ""
"The body force is assembled with a plain "
":class:`~tensormesh.NodeAssembler` on the velocity space (the order-2 "
"mesh points *are* the P2 nodes) and placed into the block vector with "
"``layout.cat``:"
msgstr ""
"体积力采用普通的 :class:`~tensormesh.NodeAssembler` 在速度空间上装配（二阶网格点 *即* P2 节点），并通过"
" ``layout.cat`` 放入块向量中："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:123
#: b2e8d7bd49824495b16481f9b9993ba6
msgid "Convergence study"
msgstr "收敛性研究"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:125
#: 5ba7313c54c747d19842ddf228e6a9ff
msgid ""
"Taylor-Hood theory promises :math:`O(h^2)` in the velocity :math:`H^1` "
"norm and :math:`O(h^2)` in the pressure :math:`L^2` norm. The script "
"measures both with quadrature-accurate error integrals:"
msgstr ""
"Taylor-Hood 理论保证速度 :math:`H^1` 范数为 :math:`O(h^2)`\\ 、压力 :math:`L^2` 范数为 "
":math:`O(h^2)`\\ 。脚本通过求积精确误差积分对两者进行测量："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:138
#: b66a18a97d7e449eb343f190ff05971c
msgid "Taylor-Hood Stokes convergence: velocity H1 and pressure L2 errors vs h"
msgstr "Taylor-Hood Stokes 收敛性：速度 H1 与压力 L2 误差随 h 变化"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:143
#: a30cf0704f0e4d5ebb7a8ce1bc6e5f62
msgid ""
"Velocity :math:`H^1` and pressure :math:`L^2` errors under uniform "
"h-refinement, both tracking the :math:`O(h^2)` reference slope."
msgstr "均匀 h 加密下速度 :math:`H^1` 和压力 :math:`L^2` 误差，两者均跟随 :math:`O(h^2)` 参考斜率。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:146
#: 6acb98d69a454619970dcab87a3620e1
msgid "Taylor-Hood Stokes solution: speed, pressure, and pointwise velocity error"
msgstr "Taylor-Hood Stokes 解：速度、压力及点态速度误差"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/stokes_taylor_hood.rst:150
#: a0ff72f5aa6d41359f5c9fc02bbe03e5
msgid ""
"Finest-level solution: speed magnitude, P1 pressure (prolonged to the P2 "
"mesh points for plotting), and the pointwise velocity error against the "
"exact solution."
msgstr "最细层级的解：速度大小、P1 压力（延拓至 P2 网格点用于绘图），以及相对于精确解的点态速度误差。"

